<title>USA: Oppenheimer wins $32.5 mln Tenn. Housing notes.</title>
<headline>Oppenheimer wins $32.5 mln Tenn. Housing notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer &amp; Co. said it won $32.5 million of Tennessee Housing Development Authority bond and revenue anticipation notes.</p>
<p>The coupon was 4.25 percent and the net interest cost (NIC) was 3.8603 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
